// The fonts M1 bundles, and the families text falls back to for characters
// a family lacks. All are Noto, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
//
// They aren't committed: `cargo run -p fetch-fonts` downloads them into
// fonts/ from pinned commits of the Noto repositories and checks each
// against its hash. CI does the same.
//
// The CJK font is the pan-CJK one: it holds Japanese, Korean and both
// Chinese forms, and its `locl` feature picks them by language.
